Z||000008||Raydar||06-02-2000||11:20 PM||||Jeez, guys. Thanks for the kind words. Giving me a serious case of the big-head.<BR>As far as I know, it's never been repainted. All of the upward facing surfaces are badly faded. Thought about having it re-clearcoated (or doing it myself). Then I saw that bright metallic red that Ford/Lincoln is using. Still thinking about that one.<BR>It's an automatic. Has air, tilt, cruise, and delay wipers, and not much else. Also has a touchpad radio that I bought a few years back, for my Firebird. <BR>Really wanted a 5-speed, until I got a "demo ride"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> in a 3.4 automatic. Not nearly as much of an issue, now.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
